{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a7b2c16f39c1cbf6ef48a8f3d535e75cd4779f65b316ca7314fbe5316e6ec384", "ja": "（今度の環の仕事は、ハロウィンイベント。\nそのための新しい衣装ができてきたんだが……）", "zh": "（环接下来的工作是万圣节活动。\n为此准备的新服装已经做好了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "434648dba7eb6a7de00c7c4d12c8be6a769b1c6e8035952d2f9150ddc8552695", "ja": "うん！\nこれならきっと、大成功だぞ……くふふ。", "zh": "嗯！\n这样一定能大获成功……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6ae8e93dc15d222da33dd81401d4e571b5664a7897e2413c81ad3c247575f3e3", "ja": "環、衣装の事なんだけど……ん？\n何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "环，关于服装的事……嗯？\n你在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "d613fbc0e955880dcfe7c2f67d685963b72ff9b9b0e51727467ac977fcc97509", "ja": "あ、おやぶん！\nたまき、新しい衣装着てみたぞ！　似合う？", "zh": "啊，老大！\n环试穿了新服装哦！合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1004_p", "source_sha256": "17c3422fe49d74eb90a6c0e41b915b32e7db4f2031c32333a9f33d5b14030471", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるぞ。\nこれなら、ハロウィンのイベントもばっちりだな。", "zh": "嗯，很适合你。\n这样一来，万圣节活动也就万无一失了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "4020140b90d5f79f49eaf555a651e54fd8cd839aed0775b87c7faa95d53aadba", "ja": "ほんとに？　ちゃんとこわい？\nオバケに見える？", "zh": "真的吗？看起来很吓人吗？\n像幽灵吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1006_p", "source_sha256": "08b7980d25d769a838ed5042c6c546470929c6d570f78fcf399af903c0446091", "ja": "怖い……かどうかはわからないけど、ちゃんと\nハロウィンのオバケには見えるぞ。どうかしたのか？", "zh": "可不可怕……倒是不好说，不过确实\n挺像万圣节幽灵的哦。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "9c5d234b5f3420ae8543e335f590850f184270fee7bc0434633c9ca07d4f1df6", "ja": "うん！　あのね、この前劇場のみんなで、\nハロウィンパーティーしたでしょ。", "zh": "嗯！是这样的，之前剧场里的大家一起办过万圣节派对，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "0541d22b8395953d2574a026ded75b6b7178a7da9d038439087aae24584700cb", "ja": "その時もたまき、オバケだったんだけど。\n育もももこも、ぜんぜん驚かなかったんだ～。", "zh": "那时候环，也扮成了幽灵，可育和桃子完全没有被吓到呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "2c1e072b79e5fe0cd69732cd8afa5c8885d340d2dd09f3e3191e0df96519bcdb", "ja": "この衣装なら、驚いてくれるかなぁ？\nきっとびっくりするぞー、くふふ♪", "zh": "穿这身服装的话，他们会被吓到吗？\n肯定会大吃一惊的——，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6a6de5740911abc2ef3721c554e9fc5e4e33166cabf2288aeb84f1ce44e96923", "ja": "そうか……でも、あんまりびっくりすると\n泣いちゃうかもしれないから、ほどほどにな。", "zh": "这样啊……不过要是太过惊讶，\n说不定会哭出来，所以还是适可而止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "cdbdfd07363297b2740cfa96d6d4b1d04d01a9b581e6978dac2b784c52c075f4", "ja": "泣いちゃう？　笑っちゃうじゃなくて？", "zh": "会哭出来？不是应该笑出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "23e7103315869ede75e694980026ad03127c22eaf38603812cd84fb22fc665b4", "ja": "環はすごくびっくりすると、笑っちゃうぞ！\nみんなも、そうじゃないの？", "zh": "环如果受到特别大的惊吓，就会笑出来哦！\n大家不也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6012169a1ab080558ddd8b2a858c1dbad0e5227cb2ab6b6b99fc98c6a8deb1e8", "ja": "なるほど……環はみんなが笑顔になるから、\nびっくりさせたいんだな？", "zh": "原来如此……因为环能让大家露出笑容，所以想吓大家一跳吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "ac3850abcea1fbcb710b793a50098762301a13d48802326fa975c85bc098adf8", "ja": "うん！\nたまき、みんなのこと笑顔にしたい！", "zh": "嗯！\n环想让大家都露出笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8c7983d2d7c931bf9325b12056c736ec292fa34da2fae4af2846e190e3e74693", "ja": "よし。ならふたりだけじゃなく、\nお客さん達の事も、びっくりさせよう！", "zh": "好。那就不只是让我们两个人，也让客人们大吃一惊吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "8213b1ba2590b36019f63bc1bf01c039c2f3c9c4ae3918f158d96f2a528d0237", "ja": "お客さんをびっくりさせるの？\nどうやって？", "zh": "要让客人们大吃一惊？\n要怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c4d64ab3fd19b0fbd531e438892ec5c40afd07eddbcb8ff3b4ef249f38543648", "ja": "もちろん、ステージでだ。\nきっとみんな、すごく笑顔になると思うぞ。", "zh": "当然是在舞台上。\n我想大家一定都会露出灿烂的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "30220b3c9ba88f9830f3b84e171980dbef562a38e0e0f2c226bee781245c555a", "ja": "そっか……わかった！\nたまき、がんばる！", "zh": "这样啊……知道了！\n环酱会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0134_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "5dc8fae3695d0ba4c8dd42181fe47b60e027564f04609186a07d15aaa99dc399", "ja": "ハロウィンのライブでみんなをおどかして、\nいっぱい笑顔にさせるぞー。くふふ♪", "zh": "在万圣节演唱会上吓大家一跳，让大家都露出满满的笑容——。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
